%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12da250283eb4d21bd2b828afb3b8a8d, type: 3}
  m_Name: DestroyEggsQuestStartDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _dialogueId: DestroyEggsQuestStartDialogue
  _dialogueData:
  - lineId: 1
    dialogueLine: Where am I?.. What happened?
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 2
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 2
    dialogueLine: You have finally woken up. You were dying when I found you in the
      swamp. Forests rarely let go of those who have fallen into their embrace. But
      you are an exception.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 3
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 3
    dialogueLine: The pain... My head is empty. I... don't remember anything.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 4
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 4
    dialogueLine: That's normal. Your body has healed, but memory is a fragile thing.
      It will return in time... or with need.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 5
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 5
    dialogueLine: Who are you?.. Why did you help me?
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 6
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 6
    dialogueLine: I am only a servant of balance. And you are a spark that has not
      yet been ignited. My forest is sick. A dark force has spawned creatures that
      have never been here. Spiders. Large, aggressive. Their eggs poison the earth
      and everything around.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 7
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 7
    dialogueLine: "And you want me to\u2026 help?"
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 8
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 8
    dialogueLine: Yes. Destroy 10 of their nests. This will cleanse the roots, and
      it will help you regain your strength. I sense two powers in you. Light and
      something else, something secret that escapes my gaze. You are both a warrior
      and a magician - a strange combination. But to find the path, you must walk
      it.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: "If it helps me get myself back\u2026I\u2019ll do it."
      nextLineId: 9
      triggerComplete: 1
    - answerText: I need to think.
      nextLineId: 10
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 9
    dialogueLine: Okay. Your journey begins now. And the forest will watch over you.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Close
      nextLineId: 
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 10
    dialogueLine: Okay, I'll wait for you to come back.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Close
      nextLineId: 
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  _alternativeDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00e3e990134b3cc46863b17059ea5601, type: 2}
  WasPlayed: 1
